26;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="138" width="575" height="33.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t3" vertex="1" parent="1" value="당시 화면 / 행동" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="650" y="138" width="575" height="33.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t4" vertex="1" parent="1" value="클라우드 전사 도착" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="138" width="575" height="33.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t5" vertex="1" parent="1" value="코드가 보존하는 의미 전 상태" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1870" y="138" width="575" height="33.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t6" vertex="1" parent="1" value="capture/time/sample 대응은 코드 / 단어와 대상의 의미는 별도" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="445" y="785" width="660" height="24.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t7" vertex="1" parent="1" value="Input + Evidence Record / u46@r1 / W46&lt;br&gt;원문/후보refs/gap / 아직 R46/T46의 정답이 아님" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1905" y="803" width="605" height="52.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t8" vertex="1" parent="1" value="공통 원본: acoustic span ↔ local sample ↔ capture interval + 오차. 수신 순서나 VAD만으로 단어 시각을 만들지 않음." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="75" y="825" width="1740" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t9" vertex="1" parent="1" value="A  E4: 필요한 원본에서 이번 Bundle 구성" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="906" width="1200" height="35.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t10" vertex="1" parent="1" value="B  E4: 유효 게시 record가 Context 읽기의 준비 조건" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1320" y="906" width="1200" height="35.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t11" vertex="1" parent="1" value="같은 P20 / Task-result / 명시 User Memory를 owner read&lt;br&gt;E5 재사용: 유효 cache/부분 갱신. 현재 정정 의미는 재판단." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="80" y="1127" width="750" height="52.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t12" vertex="1" parent="1" value="NOT_COVERED → 필요 범위 생산/검사/게시 → 재조회 → 같은 현재 해석&lt;br&gt;E5 유효 record 재사용 / E6 dependency 차단/재생산 / 원본 우회는 B+." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1370" y="1135" width="870" height="49.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t13" vertex="1" parent="1" value="E7 취소: capture 지속, 옛 의미 job과 미전송 처리 차단. E9 장애/E11 재시작: 원본이 없는 파생 view는 복원 불가." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="45" y="1240" width="2470" height="28.6" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t14" vertex="1" parent="1" value="E10 만료/철회: 원본/cache/파생 record와 미사용 job의 이용 gate 차단과 cleanup. 짧은 화면 view를 장기 기억에 자동 복제하지 않음." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="45" y="1285" width="2470" height="28.6" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t15" vertex="1" parent="1" value="그림은 관측과 Context 공급 확대. 입력 확정/Context 준비/현재 의미 채택/실제 전송은 다른 경계. A/B 품질 우위는 미검증." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="45" y="1360" width="2470" height="28.6" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
